Template: whalepi/name
Type: string
Default: 01
Description: Short name for this WhalePi system (max 6 letters/digits):
 Each WhalePi is given a short name. For example "13" makes this system
 "WhalePi_13": it sets the Bluetooth identification to 13 and the recording
 file prefix to PAM13.
 .
 Use up to 6 letters or digits only (no spaces or symbols).
